# Build-context exclusions for `hitsai/miforge-frontend`, whose context is this
# directory (docker-images.yml: `context: ./frontend`). BuildKit resolves the ignore
# file per context, so the repository root's `.dockerignore` does NOT apply here.
#
# Kept deliberately short. `tests/` is NOT excluded: `tsconfig.app.json` lists it in
# `include`, so `npm run build` (which is `tsc -b && vite build`) type-checks it, and
# excluding it would fail the image build on files that are not there.

# Installed and generated
node_modules
dist
coverage

# Playwright output (ADR-016 runs it per screen, not in the image)
test-results
playwright-report

# Local env
.env
.env.*
